        dcterms:description "From the Consilience cross-theory demo (consilience-demo.netlify.app); its results are pinned in https://github.com/Anuja-Khatri/theconsilience-engine at commit 96ba4e435bd13718d36435cc3436d938d2d1f894, results/demo/. The claim statement is a paraphrase of the source paper, drafted by a large language model and reviewed by a person, who is named in the provenance. It is not a quotation. Page locators are pages of the PDF the demo read, which can differ from printed page numbers." ;
        dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
